</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td id="main-date" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Date" class="thin" style="background-color: #eeeeee; padding: 15px;" bgcolor="#eeeeee">
<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 110%; font-weight: normal; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; margin: 0;" align="start">Small Business Agenda <strong><br></strong><strong>Impact Measurement Survey</strong>
</h1>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Dear Columbus Business Owner:</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">This is a final reminder that the City of Columbus is conducting an important survey of the small business ecosystem.</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Simply click on this address to go directly to the survey: <a href="https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942991/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-SMB?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942991/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-SMB</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">We appreciate your dedication to completing the full survey; your input is invaluable in shaping the future for small businesses in Columbus. Business owners that complete this survey will be entered into a raffle to win a $50 gift card. For questions regarding the survey, please contact Celeste LaCour-Belyn at <a href="mailto:CCLaCour-Belyn@columbus.gov" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CCLaCour-Belyn@columbus.gov</a>. </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Thank you for both your time and thoughtfulness on this survey, and we look forward to your involvement in this work.<br><br></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Sincerely,</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Henry A. Golatt Program Development Coordinator</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/development/economic-development/Small-Business/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Office of Small Business and Entrepreneur Development</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><em> </em></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><em>“Together, Let’s Make Positive Impacts”</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">City of Columbus</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Department of Development</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Economic Development Division</p>
</td>
