<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">I write to remind you on a specific ask to support the Columbus Small Business Ecosystem. The City has developed a survey targeting small businesses to inform the progress of the Columbus Small Business Agenda. We would greatly appreciate if you took the time to complete the survey estimated to take no more than 10 minutes.</p>
